WEBVTT

00:00:05.773 --> 00:00:11.773
Choose Videos in the side menu.

00:00:12.335 --> 00:00:18.335
Type "Telling" in the Search box.

00:00:19.664 --> 00:00:25.664
Click Telling the Time to open the video.

00:00:27.431 --> 00:00:33.407
Click Unpublish.

00:00:33.657 --> 00:00:39.657
Click Unpublish to confirm.

00:00:42.622 --> 00:00:48.451
Wait until you see Publish.

00:00:48.701 --> 00:00:54.701
Click Move to Trash.

00:00:56.256 --> 00:01:02.256
Click Move to Trash to confirm.

00:01:02.818 --> 00:01:08.818
Choose Trash in the side menu.

00:01:09.259 --> 00:01:15.259
Click Restore Welcome Video (old cut).

00:01:19.617 --> 00:01:25.617
Check that Delete forever is there.
